 peruvians he  represents the poor the hungry and rural  teachers  teachers who suffer the most i don't  know what more one could expect from a  politician  analysis castillo's ability to govern  will hang in the balance  with nearly half of the country  rejecting him and the other half  who demands change and who will expect  nothing less from him  than to deliver on his promises mariana  sanchez  al jazida lima peru
 

